[9.027356, "o", "\r\u001b[2K│  \u001b[33mpairs created: 4 · quarks isolated: 0\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.027555, "o", "│  \u001b[1mthe universe's first stuck loop: quarks in confinement, 13.8 Gyr,\r\n"]
[9.027624, "o", "│  no Ctrl+C. your agent's 90 seconds: rookie numbers.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.027817, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m┌─ L17 · STANDARD MODEL — the whole machine runs on 3 particles + 2 forces \u001b[2m───────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│  17 particles: 12 fermions · 4 carriers · 1 Higgs\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.129768, "o", "│  QUARKS         \u001b[36mu\u001b[0m c t      \u001b[36md\u001b[0m s b\r\n"]
[9.129914, "o", "│  LEPTONS        \u001b[36me\u001b[0m μ τ      νₑ ν_μ ν_τ\r\n"]
[9.129964, "o", "│  CARRIERS       \u001b[36mγ photon\u001b[0m · g gluon · W · Z   \u001b[2m(Higgs: gives mass)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.130037, "o", "│  highlighted — \u001b[36mup, down, electron, photon\u001b[0m — run everything: you, the GPU,\r\n│  the question. gravity is \u001b[31m10³⁶× weaker\u001b[0m: does nothing in the box; only\r\n"]
[9.130068, "o", "│  wins at planet scale because it never cancels. the weakest force runs the\r\n"]
[9.130086, "o", "│  biggest loop.\r\n"]
[9.130134, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m┌─ L18 · QUANTUM FIELDS — there are no particles. there are ripples. \u001b[2m─────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.23904, "o", "│  an electron isn't a thing in a wire — it's a quantized excitation of the\r\n"]
[9.239187, "o", "│  electron field, a field present EVERYWHERE, always. same for every\r\n│  particle. \u001b[33m'stuff' is just where the ripples are dense.\u001b[0m the Higgs\r\n│  field gives the ripple its mass — the electron's inertia is borrowed from\r\n│  a field that was already there. \u001b[31mthe machine runs on ripples.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.239227, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m┌─ L19 · THE MEASUREMENT PROBLEM — the first floor with no bottom \u001b[2m────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.239252, "o", "\u001b[2m│  superposition verified · collapse verified · WHY: unknown since 1927\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.340349, "o", "│  |ψ⟩ = (|↑⟩+|↓⟩)/√2 — BOTH, provably. look → one outcome, cleanly. the math\r\n"]
[9.340509, "o", "│  says nothing about when, why, or how. Copenhagen, Many-Worlds, pilot-wave\r\n│  — a century of the smartest loops has not terminated.\r\n"]
[9.340717, "o", "\r\n│  \u001b[2mlive: superposition, then a measurement:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
